msgid ""
"Pasting this text into the terminal may be dangerous as it looks like some "
"commands may be executed."
msgstr ""
"Testu hau terminalean itsastea arriskutsua izan daiteke komandoren batzuk "
"exekutatzea ekar dezakeelako."

